        "raw": "<p>So aside from America&#39;s Cleverest Legacy, the ARG&#39;s pages have shown us numerous potential promo characters. I think it&#39;d be fun to speculate on what powers such promos would have.</p><p>First, Omnitron-U</p><p>https://greaterthangames.com/omnitronu</p><p>Being a creation of Unity, I think his power would focus on his Components and equipment -- possibly a power that pulls one out of the trash?</p><p>And the 80s Rock Prime Wardens</p><p>https://greaterthangames.com/timevtime</p><p>As a group, going by the cover image, they seem generally angrier, so I&#39;m going to imagine they&#39;re somewhat damage based. Then again, the Prime Wardens of our &#39;verse seem to love supporting each other, so maybe that plays into it?</p><p>Argent Adept is the front man, and one hallmark of 80s rock is smashing guitars -- so for him, I imagine a power like, &quot;Do X melee damage, where X equals the number of instruments in play.&quot;</p><p>Fanatic is rocking the Tina Turner look, so maybe something with sonic damage? Perhaps modified by her teammates in some way?</p><p>Haka&#39;s the drummer, clearly. Dude is into percussion. Maybe a power so that, til the end of his next turn, every time he does melee damage, he does additional Sonic damage?</p><p>Tempest -- electric guitar. I could see him adding a lightning element and/or boost to others&#39; attacks.</p><p>Unfortunately, I&#39;ve never played with Captain Cosmic and thus can&#39;t really speculate on how a new power would affect his deck.</p><p>And then there&#39;s these guys</p><p>https://greaterthangames.com/bethegate</p><p>I&#39;m really not sure how they would play -- I&#39;ve never used half the characters in the mash ups, so y&#39;all can speculate on those.</p>",
