        "created_at": "2016-01-30T01:20:54.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>According to Christopher on today's livestream, we will see many of alternate heroes in the OblivAeon expansion, though it isn't quite clear how. Also, as previously stated, we are going to have at least one promo for every hero. The Parse promo shown off today was terrific, but apparently has many ties hinted in her regular incap side.</p>",
